    {
      "id": "nangongwan_meets_hanli_again",
      "priority": "A",
      "trigger": "battle_start",
      "speakerHeroId": "nangongwan",
      "text": "落云宗的新进长老，原来真是你。",
      "source": {
        "chapter": "第七百一十四章 昔日之心",
        "line": 33621
      },
      "conditions": {
        "heroesAll": [
          "nangongwan",
          "hanli"
        ]
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "representative",
          "text": "落云宗的新进长老，原来真是你。",
          "source": {
            "chapter": "第七百一十四章 昔日之心",
            "line": 33621
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "玉儿，你先下去，我要单独和此人谈谈。",
          "source": {
            "chapter": "第七百一十四章 昔日之心",
            "line": 33611
          },
          "quoteHash": "cac241dac253"
        },
        {
          "text": "哼！落云宗的新进长老，二百多年就进阶的元婴修士，我怎会不知道的。",
          "source": {
            "chapter": "第七百一十四章 昔日之心",
            "line": 33621
          },
          "quoteHash": "8429d73fa016"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wangchan_huangfeng_target",
      "priority": "A",
      "trigger": "battle_start",
      "speakerHeroId": "wangchan",
      "text": "这位黄枫谷弟子，倒是很有意思。",
